  "prefLabel": "Saf-Mec 501.04 Plumbing Apprentice and Fuel Gas Fitting Trainee Registration License Renewal Fees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 501.04 Plumbing Apprentice and Fuel Gas Fitting Trainee Registration License Renewal Fees. The renewal fee for a plumbing apprentice and a fuel gas fitting trainee registration license shall be as follows:\n\n(a) Renewal fee for a 2-year plumbing apprentice registration license: $80.00; and\n\n(b) Renewal fee for a 2-year fuel gas trainee registration license: $80.00.\n\nSource. #10849, eff 7-1-15",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-mec500.html"
